ā，“伺服器”)的縮寫或雙關，源自英語 server。漢字為借字 (当て字)。"],"examples":[{"en":"It's hot, so you'd better head back quickly. Mackerel goes off so fast that they coined 'fresh-looking rotten fish'.","ja":"早く帰った方がいい、暑いから。サバは、生き腐れとも言われるくらい足が早い。","ref":"328898_74821","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["鯖"],"glosses":["mackerel (esp. the chub mackerel, Scomber japonicus)","server (esp. in an online game)"],"id":"1299610","lemma":"鯖","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"サバ","readings":["さば","サバ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/鯖#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/鯖/鯖/鯖.html","https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/サバ#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/サ/サバ/サバ.html"],"synonyms":["青鯖"],"zhGlosses":["鯖魚","鯖魚，尤指白腹鯖（Scomber japonicus）","comp伺服器","好，行，可以。"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["鯖魚"],"pos":"char"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["鯖魚，尤指白腹鯖（Scomber japonicus）"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["comp伺服器"],"pos":"n sl"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["好，行，可以。"],"pos":""}]},{"common":false,"etymology":["山(さん)椒(しょう) (sanshō，“日本花椒”) + 魚(うお) (uo，“魚”)。"],"examples":[],"forms":["山椒魚","鯢"],"glosses":["salamander"],"id":"1303260","lemma":"山椒魚","pos":["n"],"readings":["サンショウウオ","さんしょううお"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/山椒魚#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/山/山椒/山椒魚.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["山椒魚","山椒魚alternative kanji"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["山椒魚"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["山椒魚alternative kanji"],"pos":"non-lemma"}]},{"accent":3,"common":false,"forms":["真魚鰹","鯧"],"glosses":["butterfish (any fish of family Stromateidae, esp. species Pampus punctatissimus)","harvestfish","rudderfish"],"id":"1363560","lemma":"真魚鰹","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"マナガツオ","readings":["まながつお","マナガツオ"]},{"accent":0,"common":false,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"What she liked best was herring roe.","ja":"彼女が最も気に入ったのは数の子でした。","ref":"308286_95419","source":"ta